  test('REPRO: Contact page (/contact): give it the same navy page header band as the other inner pages (Services, Systems, Training, Engagements, About): navy background with the data-grid motif, the small uppercase teal eyebrow \"CONTACT\", the h1 \"Book a consultation\" in white, and under it the lead \"Tell us what you\'re working on and we\'ll reply within one business day.\" and \"Prefer email? hello@thebayesgroup.com\" (the email stays a mailto link, readable on navy).', () => {
